{% raw %}<style>
  
  
  #sm-t10 {
    --brand-bg: #eff6f9;
    --brand-bg-alt: #e4f0f6;
    --brand-bg-soft: #eff6f9;
    --brand-text: #13283a;
    --brand-heading: #13283a;
    --brand-btn: #13283a;
    --brand-btn-text: #ffffff;
    --brand-btn-hover: #22405a;
    --brand-btn-2: #6fcfc8;
    --brand-btn-2-text: #13283a;
    --brand-accent: #6fcfc8;
    --brand-accent-dark: #17807b;
    --brand-border: #d3e3ec;
    --brand-divider: #bcd3df;
    --brand-star: #1f9d95;
    --brand-footer: #13283a;
    --brand-muted: #52697b;
    --radius-arch: 999px 999px 6px 6px;
    --font-head: Archivo, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-body: Karla, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    --radius: 6px;
    --radius-btn: 999px;
    --radius-lg: 6px;
    --section-pad: 64px;
    --max-width: 1280px;
    --gutter-mobile: 20px;
    --gap: 16px;
    --btn-height: 54px;
    --btn-pad-x: 24px;
    --pt: 64px;
    --pb: 64px;
  }

  #sm-t10 { background: var(--brand-bg); color: var(--brand-text); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; padding: var(--pt) 0 var(--pb); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  #sm-t10 *, #sm-t10 *::before, #sm-t10 *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: calc(var(--max-width) + 2 * var(--gutter-mobile)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--gutter-mobile); }
  #sm-t10 h1, #sm-t10 h2, #sm-t10 h3, #sm-t10 h4 { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-heading); margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-wrap: balance; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-eyebrow { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand-accent-dark); }
  #sm-t10 p, #sm-t10 ul { margin: 0; }
  #sm-t10 a { color: inherit; }
  #sm-t10 img, #sm-t10 svg, #sm-t10 video { max-width: 100%; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-h2 { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.1; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-sub { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-ic { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-ic-acc { stroke: var(--brand-accent); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-star { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--brand-star); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: var(--btn-height); padding: 0 var(--btn-pad-x); background: var(--brand-btn); color: var(--brand-btn-text); border: 2px solid var(--brand-btn); border-radius: var(--radius-btn); font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: .01em; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s, border-color .2s, transform .12s; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-btn:active { transform: scale(.97); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-btn { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-btn:hover { background: var(--brand-btn-hover); border-color: var(--brand-btn-hover); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-btn:focus-visible, #sm-t10 a:focus-visible, #sm-t10 button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--brand-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-media { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--brand-bg-soft); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-media img, #sm-t10 .sm-media svg.sm-ph, #sm-t10 .sm-media video { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  #sm-t10 svg.sm-ph { background: #dce9f0; fill: #bcd3df; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-vh { position: absolute !important; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    #sm-t10 .sm-wrap { padding: 0 40px; max-width: calc(var(--max-width) + 80px); }
    #sm-t10 .sm-h2 { font-size: 52px; }
    #sm-t10 .sm-sub { font-size: 18px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { #sm-t10 * { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; } }

  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__grid { display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__head { display: grid; gap: 12px; justify-items: start; align-content: start; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__sub { color: var(--brand-muted); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__link { font-weight: 700; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-color: var(--brand-accent); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__list { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__item { border-radius: var(--radius); background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--brand-border); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__item[open] { border-color: var(--brand-text); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__item summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__ic { flex: none; padding: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand-bg-soft); box-sizing: content-box; transition: transform .25s, background .25s; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__item[open] .sm-fq__ic { transform: rotate(45deg); background: var(--brand-accent); }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__a { padding: 0 20px 20px; color: var(--brand-muted); font-size: 15px; }
  #sm-t10 .sm-fq__a p + p { margin-top: 8px; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    #sm-t10 .sm-fq__grid { grid-template-columns: 4fr 7fr; gap: 56px; }
    #sm-t10 .sm-fq__head { position: sticky; top: 24px; }
    #sm-t10 .sm-fq__item summary { font-size: 17px; }
  }
</style>


<div id="sm-t10" class="sm-fq">
<div class="sm-wrap sm-fq__grid">
  <div class="sm-fq__head"><h2 class="sm-h2">Questions fréquentes</h2><p class="sm-sub sm-fq__sub">Une autre question ? Écrivez-nous, on répond en général dans la journée.</p><a class="sm-fq__link" href="/pages/contact">Nous contacter</a></div>
  <div class="sm-fq__list"><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>Quelle différence avec une claquette classique ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Une claquette classique, c'est une semelle plate et fine. Ici, la semelle épaisse remonte sous la voûte, le talon est creusé et tout sort du même moule.</p></div>
      </details><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>Je peux aller dans l&#x27;eau avec ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Oui, à la mer comme à la piscine. Un coup d'eau claire après le sel ou le chlore, et c'est tout.</p></div>
      </details><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>La bande ne serre pas trop ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Elle est large et souple. Pied large ou cou-de-pied haut : prenez la pointure au-dessus.</p></div>
      </details><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>Elles sentent le neuf ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Parfois un peu, à l'ouverture du colis. Laissez-les une journée à l'air libre et l'odeur s'en va.</p></div>
      </details><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>Je fais du 39,5, je prends quoi ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Le 40-41. Les pointures vont par deux : entre deux, prenez toujours la plus grande. Les longueurs de pied sont dans le guide des pointures, plus haut sur la page.</p></div>
      </details><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>Je la reçois quand ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Chaque commande part avec un numéro de suivi, envoyé par e-mail. La livraison est offerte dès 39 € d'achat.</p></div>
      </details><details class="sm-fq__item" >
        <summary>Et si elles ne me vont pas ?<svg class="sm-fq__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary>
        <div class="sm-fq__a"><p>Écrivez-nous. On échange la pointure, ou on vous rembourse si vous nous les renvoyez dans les 30 jours.</p></div>
      </details></div>
</div>
</div>

{% endraw %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Claquettes FAQ",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "sm-shell sm-static",
